ClientDeviceObjectManager ..> DeviceManagerFactory : uses

' ============================================================================
' Call Flow Notes with GPU Support
' ============================================================================

note right of HeteroClient::MGetH2D
  **MGetH2D Call Flow (NPU Path):**
  1. HeteroClient::MGetH2D()
  2. → impl_->MGetH2D()
  3. → [Async RPC] Get() → workerApi_->Get()
  4. → [Worker] WorkerOCServiceImpl::Get()
  5. → [Async Copy] HostDataCopy2Device()
  6. → devOcImpl_->MemCopyBetweenDevAndHost()
  7. → **swapInPool_->MemcpyBatch()** no FFTS
  8. → AsyncAclMemCopyPool::AclMemcpyAsync()
  9. → aclrtMemcpyAsync() [ACL API]

  **MGetH2D Call Flow (GPU Path - NEW):**
  1-6. Same as NPU path
  7. → **swapInPool_->MemcpyBatch()** 
  8. → AsyncCudaMemCopyPool::CudaMemcpyAsync()
  9. → cudaMemcpyAsync() [CUDA API]

  **Remote H2D (NPU):**
  - RemoteH2DManager::ImportSegAndReadHostMemory()
  - Direct NPU-to-NPU via HCCL/P2P-Transfer

  **Remote H2D (GPU - NEW):**
  - RemoteGpuTransferManager::ImportSegAndReadHostMemory()
  - GPU Direct RDMA
end note

note right of HeteroClient::MSetD2H
  **MSetD2H Call Flow (NPU Path):**
  1. HeteroClient::MSetD2H()
  2. → impl_->MSet()
  3. → [Async Set] DeviceDataCreate()
  4. → MultiCreate() → workerApi_->MultiCreate()
  5. → [Worker] WorkerOCServiceImpl::MultiCreate()
  6. → devOcImpl_->MemCopyBetweenDevAndHost()
  7. → **swapOutPool_->MemcpyBatch()** no FFTS
  8. → AsyncAclMemCopyPool::AclMemcpyAsync()
  9. → aclrtMemcpyAsync() [ACL API]
  10. → MultiPublish() → workerApi_->MultiPublish()
  11. → [Worker] WorkerOCServiceImpl::MultiPublish()

  **MSetD2H Call Flow (GPU Path - NEW):**
  1-6. Same as NPU path
  7. → **swapOutPool_->MemcpyBatch()**
  8. → AsyncCudaMemCopyPool::CudaMemcpyAsync()
  9. → cudaMemcpyAsync() [CUDA API]
  10-11. Same as NPU path
end note

note bottom of IAsyncMemCopyPool
  **Memory Copy Pool 抽象层:**

  **NPU Implementation (AsyncAclMemCopyPool):**
  - 对于MemcpyBatch使用SetDevice/CreateStream
    /MemcpyAsync/SynchronizeStream等接口
  - 使用copypool_线程池管理异步任务

  **GPU Implementation (AsyncCudaMemCopyPool):**
  - 采用类似NPU的实现

end note


note bottom of CudaDeviceManager
  **Implementation Tasks:**

  **Core Device Operations:**
  ✓ cudaGetDeviceCount, cudaSetDevice
  ✓ cudaMalloc, cudaFree, cudaMemcpy
  ✓ cudaMemcpyAsync (H2D, D2H, D2D)
  ✓ cudaStreamCreate, cudaStreamDestroy
  ✓ cudaStreamSynchronize
  ✓ cudaEventCreate, cudaEventRecord
  ✓ cudaEventSynchronize, cudaEventQuery

  **NCCL Collective Operations:**
  ✓ ncclGetUniqueId → CommRootInfo
  ✓ ncclCommInitRank
  ✓ ncclSend, ncclRecv (P2P)
  ✓ ncclBroadcast, ncclAllReduce (collective)
  ✓ ncclCommDestroy

  **P2P Operations:**
  ✓ cudaIpcGetMemHandle (same node)
  ✓ cudaIpcOpenMemHandle (same node)
  ✓ cudaDeviceEnablePeerAccess
  ✓ NCCL P2P for cross-node

  **Not Supported (Return K_NOT_SUPPORTED):**
  ✗ Notify operations (NPU-specific FFTS)
  ✗ LaunchCallback (use CUDA callbacks instead)
  ✗ ProcessReport/SubscribeReport (NPU-specific)
end note

@enduml
